  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call upon your dragonmark's power to better locate objects. When you Cast the Spell, any time you @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{Recall Knowledge (Lore)}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{Identify Magic}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.fJImDBQfqfjKJOhk]{Sense Direction}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.49y9Ec4bDii8pcD3]{Subsist}, or @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.EA5vuSgJfiHH7plD]{Track}. You gain a +1 status bonus to perception or the skill used for the roll. This bonus remains as long as you @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.3f5DMFu8fPiqHpRg]{Sustain a Spell}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You do not need to sustain Hunter's Intuition.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The bonus increases to +2.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The bonus increases to +3.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\">@UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron-compendium.eberron-effects.qtJ2HSJj1ArOiYLd]{Spell Effect: Hunter's Intuition}</p>"
    },
